{
  "$comment": "同一个槽位在四端必须解析到同一个 token。现有门禁比的是 props/events 签名,比不到像素 —— 这份比的是像素。每条 slot 给出四端各自的文件与必须出现的 token 引用;裸字面量即失败。",
  "slots": [
    {
      "id": "MessageBubble.padding",
      "why": "气泡是全 app 出现频率最高的组件;四端内距不同,同一条消息的高度就不同。",
      "token": "sizes.component.bubblePaddingX / bubblePaddingY",
      "platforms": {
        "ios": {
          "file": "packages/ios-im-ui/Sources/FlareIMUI/Components/MessageBubbleView.swift",
          "require": [
            "FlareSizes.componentBubblePaddingX",
            "FlareSizes.componentBubblePaddingY"
          ],
          "forbid": [
            "\\.padding\\(\\.horizontal, 14\\)",
            "\\.padding\\(\\.vertical, 9\\)"
          ]
        },
        "android": {
          "file": "packages/android-im-ui/src/main/kotlin/com/flare/im/ui/MessageBubble.kt",
          "require": [
            "FlareSizes.componentBubblePaddingX",
            "FlareSizes.componentBubblePaddingY"
          ],
          "forbid": [
            "horizontal = 14\\.dp",
            "vertical = 9\\.dp"
          ]
        },
        "flutter": {
          "file": "packages/flutter-im-ui/lib/src/components/flare_message_bubble.dart",
          "require": [
            "FlareSizes.componentBubblePaddingX",
            "FlareSizes.componentBubblePaddingY"
          ],
          "forbid": [
            "horizontal: 14",
            "vertical: 9"
          ]
        },
        "vue": {
          "file": "packages/vue-im-ui/src/design-system/styles/chat/message-bubble.css",
          "require": [
            "--flare-size-component-bubble-padding-x",
            "--flare-size-component-bubble-padding-y"
          ],
          "forbid": [
            "padding: var\\(--flare-size-spacing-sm\\) 11px"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "MessageBubble.radius",
      "why": "唯一真源早就有 radius.bubble=16 / bubbleTail=4,三端在用;Vue 曾另立 13/6 与 radius-xl/lg 两套竞争定义。 Android 已改为引用 token(原本钉的是 16\\.dp / 4\\.dp 两个字面量,与本门禁「比 token 引用而非数值」的原则相反);iOS 与 Flutter 仍钉字面量,待同样改造。",
      "token": "sizes.radius.bubble / bubbleTail",
      "platforms": {
        "ios": {
          "file": "packages/ios-im-ui/Sources/FlareIMUI/Components/MessageBubbleView.swift",
          "require": [
            "radius: CGFloat = 16",
            "tailRadius: CGFloat = 4"
          ]
        },
        "android": {
          "file": "packages/android-im-ui/src/main/kotlin/com/flare/im/ui/MessageBubble.kt",
          "require": [
            "FlareSizes\\.radiusBubble\\b",
            "FlareSizes\\.radiusBubbleTail\\b"
          ]
        },
        "flutter": {
          "file": "packages/flutter-im-ui/lib/src/components/flare_message_bubble.dart",
          "require": [
            "Radius.circular\\(16\\)",
            "Radius.circular\\(4\\)"
          ]
        },
        "vue": {
          "file": "packages/vue-im-ui/src/design-system/styles/chat/message-bubble.css",
          "require": [
            "--flare-size-radius-bubble",
            "--flare-size-radius-bubble-tail"
          ],
          "forbid": [
            "--flare-component-bubble-radius"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
